    "c-dj-fusion": {
      "text": "Certain consecutive instruction pairs issue as one uop: flag-setting ALU + b.cc, ALU + cbz/cbnz, aese + aesmc, aesd + aesimc, aese/aesd + eor, pmull + eor, and amx + amx",
